00:31:52,780 --> 00:31:55,490
- I'm not always that bad.     - Oh, yeah?

482
00:31:55,660 --> 00:31:58,080
What happened when we played last time?

483
00:31:58,290 --> 00:32:00,200
I punched you.

484
00:32:00,750 --> 00:32:04,290
